<section class="sec">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">Questions</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Things people ask <span class="serif">about us.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">Not about courses. About us. Who we are and whether we are the right fit.</p>
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>Is Cokonet Academy accredited? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Cokonet Academy is listed with NASSCOM. Our curriculum is aligned with AWS, Microsoft, and SAP certification frameworks. For exact accreditation status, write to learn@cokonet.com.</div></details>
<details><summary>How long has Cokonet been operating? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Since 2010, continuously. Through the pandemic, through three-city expansion, through 16 years of placements. Not a startup. A track record.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is Cokonet suitable for working professionals? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes. About 40% of our learners are working professionals. Weekend batches and flexible schedules on every programme. Our record ₹18 LPA salary came from a professional who switched via SAP FICO.</div></details>
<details><summary>Where are your offices? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Three offices. Trivandrum HQ at Peedikayil Chambers, Ulloor, Kerala 695011. Bengaluru. Kochi. All three run live programmes. Online delivery is available for learners outside these cities.</div></details>
